Description:
 bashship   - A minimal, fast, and highly customizable bash prompt
 bashship-docs - Documentation for Bashship
 bashship-man - Manual page for Bashship
Changes:
 bashship (1.4.4) stable; urgency=low
 .
   * fix: Update shellcheck directives for variable assignments in __git-status and __bash-prompt functions
   * fix: Add echo statements to improve feedback during manual page and source file builds
   * fix: Update Conflicts version for bashship to ensure compatibility
   * fix: Enhance host detection logic and improve directory path handling in prompt functions
   * fix: Correct CHANGELOG_ITERATION value in .env to maintain versioning consistency
   * fix: Rearrange _pandoc and _out targets in Makefile for improved structure
   * fix: Remove echo statement for manpage installation in Makefile
   * fix: Correct file copy commands in Makefile for documentation directory
   * fix: Update Makefile to dynamically set application name and improve manual page build process
   * fix: Update package suggestions to include bashship-man
   * fix: Update .gitignore to include _build directory
   * feat: Add manpage installation support in rules and create bashship-man.manpages file
   * fix: Add bashship-man directory to .gitignore to prevent unwanted commits
   * feat: Add bashship-man package and include manual page for documentation
   * feat: Add bashship-docs package and update control file for documentation support
